{"sha": "b69817be6fb9a265e142668d7e7b518ed45a8b821b3c28c5dd63ae6dfaaa7f64", "body": ["\\chapter{负数}\\label{ch:g7:negatives}", "", "零下的温度、地下的楼层、欠款：许多", "量都会小于 $0$。负数把数轴延伸到零的", "左侧。本章学习如何比较它们，以及如何加", "减它们 --- 它们的乘法留待", "在\\cref{ch:g8:negprod}中学习。", "", "\\section{正负数}", "", "\\begin{definition}[正负数]\\label{def:g7:negatives:def}", "一个\\emph{正负数}\\index{正负数}由符号", "（$+$ 或 $-$）和\\emph{到零的距离}：$+3$ 与 $-3$", "的距离都是 $3$，位于 $0$ 的两侧。正数通常", "省略符号书写：$+3 = 3$。$+3$ 与 $-3$ 互为", "\\emph{相反数}\\index{相反数}。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.15]", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-5.6,0) -- (5.6,0);", "  \\foreach \\x in {-5,...,5} \\draw (\\x,-0.08) -- (\\x,0.08);", "  \\foreach \\x in {-5,...,5} \\node[below, font=\\small] at (\\x,-0.1) {$\\x$};", "  \\fill[omThm] (-3,0) circle (2pt);", "  \\fill[omDef] (3,0) circle (2pt);", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth, omExo] (-3,0.35) -- (0,0.35)", "    node[midway, above, font=\\small] {$3$};", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth, omExo] (0,0.35) -- (3,0.35)", "    node[midway, above, font=\\small] {$3$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 数轴向左延伸：$-3$ 与 $+3$ 互为", "相反数，到 $0$ 的距离相等。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[比较正负数]\\label{met:g7:negatives:compare}", "在数轴上，越靠左的数越小。实际比较时：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 负数总小于正数：", "        $-7 < 2$；", "  \\item 两个正数之间，按通常的大小顺序；", "  \\item 两个负数中，到零的距离\\emph{较大}者", "        则\\emph{较小}：$-7 < -2$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g7:negatives:compare}", "按从小到大的顺序排列：$3$、$-5$、$0$、$-1.5$、$2.8$。", "先排负数，其中最小的数排在最前面：", "\\[", "-5 < -1.5 < 0 < 2.8 < 3 .", "\\]", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{正负数的加法}", "", "可以把一个正负数看作数轴上的一次移动：$+5$ 表示", "“向右走 $5$ 步”，$-3$ 表示“向左走 $3$ 步”。做加法", "就是把这些移动依次连接起来。", "", "\\begin{method}[两个正负数相加]\\label{met:g7:negatives:add}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item \\emph{同号}：将两数的距离相加，保留相同的符号：", "        $(-3) + (-4) = -7$。", "  \\item \\emph{异号}：用较大的距离减去较小的距离，", "        取较大距离所对应数的符号：", "        $(-7) + (+2) = -5$ 与 $(+7) + (-2) = +5$。", "  \\item 互为相反数的两个数相加得零：$(+4) + (-4) = 0$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.05]", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-5.4,0) -- (4.4,0);", "  \\foreach \\x in {-5,...,4} \\draw (\\x,-0.07) -- (\\x,0.07);", "  \\foreach \\x in {-5,-3,-1,0,2,4}", "    \\node[below, font=\\small] at (\\x,-0.09) {$\\x$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (0,0.35) -- (-3.5,0.35);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, very thick] (-3.5,0.75) -- (-1.5,0.75);", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small] at (-1.75,0.18) {$-3.5$};", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small] at (-2.5,1.0) {$+2$};", "  \\fill (-1.5,0) circle (2pt) node[below=6pt, font=\\small] {$-1.5$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 把加法看作移动：从 $0$ 出发，先移动 $-3.5$，再移动", "$+2$，到达 $(-3.5) + 2 = -1.5$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g7:negatives:add}", "逐步计算，可按方便的方式分组：", "\\begin{align*}", "(-8) + (+3) &= -5 && \\text{(异号：} 8 - 3 = 5,", "\\text{ 取符号 } 8)\\\\", "(-2.5) + (-1.5) &= -4 && \\text{(同号：距离相加)}\\\\", "(+6) + (-9) + (+3) &= (-3) + (+3) = 0 .", "\\end{align*}", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{正负数的减法}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[减法法则]\\label{thm:g7:negatives:sub}", "减去一个正负数，等同于\\emph{加上它的", "相反数}：", "\\[", "a - b = a + (-b) .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}[为何成立]", "$a - b$ 是加上 $b$ 后得 $a$ 的数。检验", "$a + (-b)$ 是否满足要求：", "$\\bigl(a + (-b)\\bigr) + b = a + \\bigl((-b) + b\\bigr) = a + 0 = a$.", "\\end{proof}", ""]}